    {
      "id": "9fcc7a17-6581-4766-bfcd-efef2edcc813",
      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-02-09T00:21:52.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹181 (vs ₹156 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹181 (up from ₹156 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹48.9b (up 9.4% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹5.33b (up 16% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 11% (in line with 3Q 2025). Revenue is forecast to grow 8.9% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 11% growth forecast for the Auto Components industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 18% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 28% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
    {
      "id": "b2d4d97c-2923-4c7c-a7b8-6b9e902e3b9d",
      "type": "event",
      "date": "2026-02-06T13:32:00.000Z",
      "title": "Bosch Limited Approves Amendments to Dividend Distribution Policy",
      "body": "Bosch Limited at its board meeting held on February 6, 2026 announced that the board approved the amendments to Dividend Distribution Policy. Dividend will generally be declared once a year, after the approval of the Audited Financial Statement and shall be subject to approval /confirmation of shareholders at the Annual General Meeting (AGM). In certain years and to commemorate special occasions, the Board may consider declaring special dividend for its shareholders. Considering the above factors, the Company would endeavor to declare a Dividend (excluding any special dividend or a payout in the form of a one time /special dividend) in the range of 55%-85% of the PAT and can go up to a maximum of 100% of PAT.",
      "keyDevTypeId": "45",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf3de3c0-b6ed-4941-8e86-26b7b318f55e",
      "type": "event",
      "date": "2026-02-06T13:32:00.000Z",
      "title": "Bosch Limited Appoints Sanmay Dasgupta as Senior Management Personnel, Effective February 06, 2026",
      "body": "Bosch Limited at its board meeting held on February 6, 2026 announced that Based on the recommendations of the Nomination and Remuneration Committee, approved the appointment of Mr. Sanmay Dasgupta, as Senior Management Personnel (SMP) with effect from February 06, 2026. He is a Mechanical Engineer with 25+ years of professional experience; currently pursuing a doctoral program. His career includes both India-based and global roles in engineering and industrial domains. His two tenures with the Bosch Group (Rexroth business): 2002-2017: Held leadership roles in sales, service, project management, and general management; worked across multiple Indian locations and completed an assignment in Germany, 2023-Jan 2026: Heading the Industrial Hydraulics business in India. Between the two Bosch st",
      "keyDevTypeId": "16",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
    },
